      "writtenOn": "2016-02-16T23:15:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This means that the RW_B image is compiled specifically for the upper half. They\u0027re not interchangeable. How do we (Google) determine which RW image needs updating?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 64,
        "startChar": 37,
        "endLine": 65,
        "endChar": 28
      },
      "revId": "2d8166471f347347673afd16af31eb0ac674ca3b",
